	<body bgcolor="#ffffff" text="#000000">
		<h1 class="largetext">Rodcetnife.org Forums</h1>
		<h2 class="normaltext">General Category => Rodcet Nife Guilds => Topic started by: Fernis on October 19, 2004, 11:32:01 am</h2>

		<table width="90%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr>
				<td>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Fernis</b> on <b>October 19, 2004, 11:32:01 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">A Warm Hello to All,<br /><br /><b>Thanks to the wonderful players that have joined DN and their hard work we have shifted our focus as a guild and have become more &quot;Raid&quot; oriented.</b> We currently raid at least 5 nights a week. We raid 8pm EST Wed, Fri, Sat, and Sun is set aside for epic 1.5 raid encounters. There is also a chance of a random raid being called during non scheduled raid days to ease the pressure of back flagging.<br /><br /><b>DN is now Officially an &quot;Time Flagged Guild&quot;</b> 8)<br /><br /><b>Applications are Closed</b><br /><br />If you have any questions feel free to contact me (Ferniss) or one of the officers Plinko, Siduri, Lafaye or Gopix in game. <br />You can also visit our website at http://www.dawningnemesis.com</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Laylina</b> on <b>October 19, 2004, 01:55:26 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">awww Ferniss...Miss ya already !!!<br /><br />If you are looking for a fun group of people to just hang around with, you couldnt pick very many more fun than Ferniss.&nbsp; Good luck with your new adventure hun !!<br /><br />HUGS!!<br /><br /> :aktion031:</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Fernis</b> on <b>October 21, 2004, 10:04:55 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">We are currently accepting applications from all classes.<br /><br />We have a min lvl requirement of 65.<br /><br />Drama Queens need not apply!<br /><br />Contact Ferniss, Plinko, Jeran, Baelnom or Prodigy in the game with any questions.<br /><br />http://www.dawningnemesis.com</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>kina</b> on <b>October 31, 2004, 05:32:31 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">laylina&nbsp; :hitit: for real.&nbsp; I&#039;ll be contacting you in game ferniss...seems like a really cool guild.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Plinko</b> on <b>December 29, 2004, 04:45:02 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">We are still recuteing&nbsp;  :headbanger: come Join the Fun  ...</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Prodigy</b> on <b>January 06, 2005, 12:18:19 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Bump </div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Fernis</b> on <b>January 13, 2005, 10:09:02 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><b>If you are interested in joining us and need the flags now is the time to apply, because after this pass it may be a couple months before we make another full PoP flagging run.</b><br /><br />As a side note <b>DN has completed our first 1.5 Epic</b>. Grats to Sikar (70 Bst). More will be coming in the near future as we now have a suitably sized and wonderfully skilled raid force. I will make a page on the web site listing the new epics as we get them.<br /><br /><br />As always if you have any questions please contact me (Ferniss) or one of the officers Baelnom, Jeran, Plinko, Prodigy or Docevill in game.<br /><br />You can also visit our website at http://www.dawningnemesis.com</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Calidiel</b> on <b>January 23, 2005, 09:07:17 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Just wanted to say howdy to Fernis and all my old friends.&nbsp; Grats on Elementals guys.&nbsp; I am still in Iraq, but I will be back soon.&nbsp; Hope to see ya all in game.&nbsp; PEACE!</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
